Story update — EApp Boomi client-side integration
Status: Development complete
Component: Dynamics 365 Opportunity form → Boomi → EApp SSO
Scope: Client-side integration only (D365 web resources + form script wiring)

Summary
Client-side EApp SSO integration is complete. Agents can launch EApp from the Opportunity form using a reusable MSAL + Boomi auth library. Configuration is driven by Dataverse environment variables (no hard-coded secrets in form scripts). First-time sign-in uses a full-page redirect that auto-completes the Boomi call and opens EApp without a second button click.

