Technical notes
Two-token model: Browser uses delegated user token (scp = access_as_user) to authenticate to Boomi. Boomi calls the Azure Function with its own client-credentials token (roles = Contact.Read / Opportunity.Read). User identity flows as userId (Dataverse systemuserid).
Prerequisite web resources: kofc_authclient.js, kofc_authcallback.html, kofc_msalbrowsermin
Entra setup required: SPA redirect URI for kofc_authcallback.html must be registered in the app registration
Out of scope (separate stories / teams)
Boomi process/API gateway configuration (server-side)
Azure Function App (getSOReqForEappSSO) deployment and Easy Auth setup
